            <div xml:id="d697-a2">

                <pb facs="0562" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg480"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                            Members of the Diplomatic Corps.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Colleague</hi>: At the suggestion of His
                    Excellency Count Massiglia, I beg to invite you to a brief informal conference
                    of some members of the resident diplomatic corps to be held at this embassy
                    to-day, Wednesday afternoon, at 4 o’clock.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.],</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane
                    Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
